      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "exit",
        "title": "Suicide, under suspicious circumstances",
        "description": "The player has the Hobb lead but couldn't show murder: Prout goes into the Captain's book as a suicide and onto the dead-cart, with Kell's objection written beside it. The lead still stands: find Hobb at the Drowned Rat.",
        "closing": "Kell writes her objection in full and signs it. Prout goes out of the yard on the cart under a sheet, past the Assembly bunting. She says, drily, that a suspicious death is still a question, and asks where the Drowned Rat is from here.",
        "result": "mixed",
        "exitKind": "progress",
        "next": "caerwyn-afternoon",
        "effects": [
          {
            "op": "quest",
            "quest": "hanged-clerk",
