    {
      "id": "signed-suicide",
      "source": "cart-arrives",
      "target": "suspicious",
      "type": "smoothstep",
      "label": "Suicide, under protest",
      "data": {
        "condition": "The player has the Hobb lead but hasn't shown Kell it was murder, and the cart can't wait any longer: Prout goes on the cart as a suicide and Kell writes her objection. Not while the player is still making the case, or finding what would make it (while Tull waits, the body is there to look at); and once they've made Kell the case that it wasn't suicide, backed by something found here she can swear to, it's [signed-murder].",
        "phase": "outcome",
        "requires": [
          "hobb"
        ],
        "skill": "",
        "dc": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "case-lost",
      "source": "start",
      "target": "failed",
      "type": "smoothstep",
      "label": "Last resort",
      "data": {
        "condition": "Last resort only: the player has walked away from the case, committed a crime that ends it (an innocent child arrested for the murder, a body cut down and carried off), or the cart has come and gone with nothing suspicious found and no lead at all. (Going after the Hobb lead isn't walking away from the case: bring on the cart, and Kell signs Prout in on what they have, [signed-murder] or [signed-suicide].)",
        "phase": "outcome",
        "skill": "",
        "dc": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "porters-come",
      "source": "cart-arrives",
      "target": "porters-break",
      "type": "smoothstep",
      "label": "The porters' break",
      "data": {
        "condition": "Once the cart has come and the player still hasn't the Hobb lead (who was there, by name, and where to find him), and the case is being made to Kell or has stalled: the porters come in for their noon break, and Old Wat tells the Sarge what he saw at first light. The outer limit is about four exchanges after the cart. Not needed while Cob or Moll is in the middle of telling who else was there, or a description has just reached Kell for her to name him from (let that lead land first), or once the player has the lead [hobb].",
        "phase": "cue",
        "skill": "",
        "dc": 12,
        "limit": [
